TKMM (Tears of the Kingdom Mod Manager)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:   https://github.com/TKMM-Team/Tkmm
Used:     Modular's Tears of the Kingdom merge installer (Modular.Switch.Totk)
          ports behaviour and code from TKMM v2.0.0-rc1: the install and merge
          flow (TKMM.cs), ROM provider configuration (TkConfig.cs), emulator,
          Ryujinx, symlink and directory helpers, export locations and the
          external 7-Zip reader.

